<!--
    No permissions. The stale-export reminder used to be a WorkManager job posting a system
    notification, which cost POST_NOTIFICATIONS here and dragged WAKE_LOCK, ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,
    RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED and FOREGROUND_SERVICE into the merged manifest of every build via
    androidx.work — six permissions, in an app whose whole pitch is that it needs none. The
    reminder is now StaleExportReminder, an in-app banner. See app/src/foss/AndroidManifest.xml
    for the guarded permission set.
-->
